  designNotes: "Beat 5: fight upward. The platform garrison cannot be reached on
    a flat arc, so the drag has to be lofted \u2014 the first level where the ANGLE
    matters more than the power. Bunker moved 1.8 -> 5.0; at 11.3 the separation
    was the worst in the campaign and the whole fight sat on top of the player. Rule
    7 warns and is ACCEPTED for the same reason as L3: the back rank needs 101% power
    for the platform garrison and cannot reach it, front rank 88%. Fighting upward
    IS the beat, and the shortfall is 1% \u2014 worth watching if the tower ever
    moves out. Structure hp RETUNED 2026-08-07: bunker hpScale 0.55 (250 -> 137),
    garrisoned total 340 -> 227, under the 288 a stock squad can do in a whole battle.
    The tower stack is untouched - fighting upward is the beat, and tow_base carries
    no garrison."
